---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import LanguagePicker from '../../components/LanguagePicker.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Comate — General-purpose Agent task workspace" description="Learn how Comate helps individuals control their Workspace, model choices, permissions, and extensions inside organizational environments.">
  <Nav><LanguagePicker slot="language-picker" /><LanguagePicker slot="language-picker-mobile" /></Nav>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent">About Comate</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-text-primary md:text-6xl">Bring Agents into real work while keeping control</h1>
    <section class="mt-8 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-lg leading-8 text-text-secondary">
      <p>Comate is a general-purpose Agent task workspace for individual professionals. It brings Sessions, task execution, files, tools, and progress into one desktop environment for many kinds of everyday work.</p>
      <p>You manage your own Workspace, choose the Agent backend and model Provider, grant tool permissions explicitly, and extend everyday work through Skills, MCP, and organization-approved integrations.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="mt-12 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
      <h2 id="principles-title" class="md:col-span-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-text-primary">Our product principles</h2>
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Individual control</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-text-secondary">You manage the Workspace, with explicit choices for models, Providers, permissions, and extensions.</p></article>
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Fits organizational environments</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-text-secondary">Connections to internal models, IM, and Skill Markets continue to follow organizational identity, permission, and data boundaries.</p></article>
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Transparent execution</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-text-secondary">Task status, tool calls, permission requests, and results stay visible so you can step in when needed.</p></article>
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Open extension</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-text-secondary">The project is open source under Apache License 2.0; source, releases, and issue tracking are public on GitHub.</p></article>
    </section>
    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/comate/en/faq/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-lg bg-accent px-5 py-2.5 font-semibold text-accent-foreground no-underline hover:bg-accent-hover">Read the FAQ</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/ai-dvps/comate" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-lg border border-border px-5 py-2.5 font-semibold text-text-primary no-underline hover:bg-surface-hover">View the GitHub repository</a>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
